<title>JAPAN: Sanix plans share split.</title>
<headline>Sanix plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sanix Co Ltd said on Wednesday it planned a 1.5-for-1 share split on March 19, 1997, for shareholders as of January 31.</p>
